    "detailed_description": "Experience a 2D side-scrolling narrative adventure infused with puzzles and a dash of action, unfurling the compelling story of evolution in the merciless oceans.<br><br>Witness the fierce competition among species as they adapt to the harsh environment, mirroring the relentless struggle for survival. As a player, you will navigate this intricate web of existence, making crucial decisions, confronting perils, and unraveling the concealed secrets of evolution.<br><br><br><br><strong>Visual Style</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/7a483810de6b03712401fa5624a32984.poster.avif?t=1738054474\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/7a483810de6b03712401fa5624a32984.webm?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/7a483810de6b03712401fa5624a32984.mp4?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A captivating play of light and darkness takes center stage, evoking a constant duality.<br></li><li> Vivid splashes of color punctuate a predominantly grayscale world.<br></li><li> The ocean's depths, shrouded in mystery, blend realism with a touch of fantasy.<br></li><li> A seamless, interface-free integration ensures an organic gameplay experience.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Mechanics</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/8f9c9bc115337cbb03608e8ab32e5b46.poster.avif?t=1738054474\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/8f9c9bc115337cbb03608e8ab32e5b46.webm?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/8f9c9bc115337cbb03608e8ab32e5b46.mp4?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a spectrum of uses: charge, electrocute, create nests, and witness your species evolve progressively.<br></li><li> Unleash special evolutionary abilities, from shining brightly to biting ferociously.<br></li><li> Genre amalgamation: narrative adventure, puzzle, action, combat.<br></li><li> An organic feeding system.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles, secure scarce food sources, confront enemies, evade the formidable, and defeat colossal bosses.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Progression</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/6185b821252b12135983fceaf40f6ada.poster.avif?t=1738054474\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/6185b821252b12135983fceaf40f6ada.webm?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/6185b821252b12135983fceaf40f6ada.mp4?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels/maps feature diverse zones: Exploration, Puzzle, Action, and Story Development.<br></li><li> Save progress at nests.<br></li><li> Visual progression unfolds from the ocean's depths to the surface, marked by enhanced lighting and evolving flora and fauna.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Experience a 2D side-scrolling narrative adventure infused with puzzles and a dash of action, unfurling the compelling story of evolution in the merciless oceans.<br><br>Witness the fierce competition among species as they adapt to the harsh environment, mirroring the relentless struggle for survival. As a player, you will navigate this intricate web of existence, making crucial decisions, confronting perils, and unraveling the concealed secrets of evolution.<br><br><br><br><strong>Visual Style</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/7a483810de6b03712401fa5624a32984.poster.avif?t=1738054474\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/7a483810de6b03712401fa5624a32984.webm?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/7a483810de6b03712401fa5624a32984.mp4?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A captivating play of light and darkness takes center stage, evoking a constant duality.<br></li><li> Vivid splashes of color punctuate a predominantly grayscale world.<br></li><li> The ocean's depths, shrouded in mystery, blend realism with a touch of fantasy.<br></li><li> A seamless, interface-free integration ensures an organic gameplay experience.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Mechanics</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/8f9c9bc115337cbb03608e8ab32e5b46.poster.avif?t=1738054474\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/8f9c9bc115337cbb03608e8ab32e5b46.webm?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/8f9c9bc115337cbb03608e8ab32e5b46.mp4?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a spectrum of uses: charge, electrocute, create nests, and witness your species evolve progressively.<br></li><li> Unleash special evolutionary abilities, from shining brightly to biting ferociously.<br></li><li> Genre amalgamation: narrative adventure, puzzle, action, combat.<br></li><li> An organic feeding system.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles, secure scarce food sources, confront enemies, evade the formidable, and defeat colossal bosses.</li></ul><br><br><strong>Progression</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/6185b821252b12135983fceaf40f6ada.poster.avif?t=1738054474\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/6185b821252b12135983fceaf40f6ada.webm?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710880/extras/6185b821252b12135983fceaf40f6ada.mp4?t=1738054474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels/maps feature diverse zones: Exploration, Puzzle, Action, and Story Development.<br></li><li> Save progress at nests.<br></li><li> Visual progression unfolds from the ocean's depths to the surface, marked by enhanced lighting and evolving flora and fauna.</li></ul>",
